   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro by \"Robert Goulet\"**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Ghostbusters**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Dancefloors**: back after 24 archived shows (500 days) [2]\n- **Make it With You**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Wonderful [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-10-31.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 112 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A person dressed as Robert Goulet introduced the band as The Ghostbusters [1]\n- The entire band wore Ghostbusters costumes, including inflatable backpacks [1]\n- The performance was captured on a bread cover [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-10-31.flac16**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Oktava MC012 (card caps/DIN) > UA5 > RCA Out* > JB3 [1]",
